### 2. 取数 SQL
```sql
SELECT `ORDER_ID`,
       `ORDER_DATE`,
       `CATEGORY`,
       `CUSTOMER_NAME`,
       SUM(`SALES`) AS `total_sales`,
       SUM(`QUANTITY`) AS `total_quantity`,
       AVG(`DISCOUNT`) AS `average_discount`,
       SUM(`PROFIT`) AS `total_profit`
FROM sales_data
GROUP BY `ORDER_ID`,
         `ORDER_DATE`,
         `CATEGORY`,
         `CUSTOMER_NAME`
LIMIT 10000
```
