### 2. 取数 SQL
```sql
SELECT `商品ID`,
       `商品名称`,
       SUM(`采购量`) AS `总采购量`,
       SUM(`采购总价格`) AS `总采购金额`
FROM
  (SELECT `order_date` AS `采购日期`,
          product_id AS `商品ID`,
          product_name AS `商品名称`,
          category AS `商品类型`,
          sub_category AS `商品子类型`,
          quantity AS `采购量`,
          sales AS `采购总价格`
   FROM sales_data) t
GROUP BY `商品ID`,
         `商品名称`
LIMIT 10000
